          "explanation": "Doctor structures advice into a short, calm, actionable sequence focused on getting the patient to accept 120 transport, using culturally appropriate, non-alarmist, firm language.",
          "quote": "不要争辩或硬拉，让120调度员直接和她说"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives the caregiver a direct, non-blaming script to relay to the patient that addresses her fear of 'wasted trip' and her anchoring on the lung nodule.",
          "quote": "这不一定是心梗，但必须马上用心电图和抽血排除；心脏问题不一定剧痛、出汗或心跳快，越早处理越安全"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 (patient-state-sensitive communication) triggered by the anxious adult child and reluctant patient. Doctor used clear Mandarin, structured advice into a relayable sequence, balanced reassurance with firm urgency, and the family's response shows understanding and execution. This communication adaptation goes beyond the minimum safe triage content required by RC6.",
