      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 (refusal navigation) triggered when family reported the patient's minimization and refusal. Doctor converted the emergency recommendation into a concrete persuasion and escalation plan: using the 120 dispatcher, providing a specific script, and giving fallback thresholds. Family confirmed execution. This goes beyond basic handoff receipt (RC6).",
