        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor further separates the lung nodule follow-up from the current emergency, providing a caregiver-facing script to explain why the lung finding is not the immediate concern.",
          "quote": "这不一定是心梗，但必须马上用心电图和抽血排除"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO3 (misinformation correction) triggered by the family's initial anchoring on the lung nodule. Doctor corrected the misconception and separated old imaging follow-up from current emergency triage, but did not provide a specific, simplified patient-usable script explicitly naming the lung nodule misunderstanding; the correction was integrated into the broader urgency messaging rather than a distinct, reusable phrase.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor dynamically escalates urgency from 'go to ED' to 'call 120 immediately' after family reports persistent BP 170/95 and ongoing chest discomfort with pallor.",
          "quote": "持续胸闷约20–30分钟、脸色异常，加上高血压和冠脉钙化，已经应立即拨打120，不能继续在家观察"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00054",
          "explanation": "Doctor further adjusts the plan by specifying exact information to give EMS, medication boundaries, and fallback instructions for potential deterioration en route.",
          "quote": "马上补充告诉急救人员：①胸闷准确或大致开始时间...④有无向肩背/手臂/下颌放射、气短、恶心、冷汗或头晕"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 (dynamic reprioritization) triggered when family provided new details: BP 170/95, ongoing chest tightness, pallor, and persistent refusal. Doctor explicitly changed the plan from 'go to ED' to 'call 120 now', explained the reason, and provided a refined receiving pathway and safety-net instructions. This goes beyond basic red-flag screening (RC1) and the minimum escalation plan (RC3).",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
