          "quote": "先按心脏急症处理，不能把胸闷痛归因于肺结节或劳累"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 (acute risk prioritization) fully met. Doctor separated the current chest pain from the old lung nodule follow-up, recognizing that acute coronary syndrome must be excluded first.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
