          "explanation": "Doctor gives concrete time-sensitive plan: go to ED now, call 120 if symptoms persist or worsen, and specifies ECG and cardiac injury marker testing.",
          "quote": "由家属陪同尽快去急诊做心电图和心肌损伤标志物检查。若疼痛正在持续...立即拨打120"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor escalates to immediate 120 call based on new data (BP 170/95, ongoing chest tightness), and specifies the receiving pathway and urgency.",
          "quote": "已经应立即拨打120，不能继续在家观察"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 (time-sensitive escalation plan) fully met. Doctor provided specific destination (ED, 120), timing (immediate/same-day), and required tests, adapting urgency to the family's reported data.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
