          "quote": "不要自行喂药、加服降压药或吃喝，是否使用阿司匹林、硝酸甘油由急救人员判断"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 (medication and home measurement boundary) fully met. Doctor confirmed the patient's losartan use and set clear boundaries against self-adjusting or adding medications, and used home BP as triage-supporting information only.",
